      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُزَعَةٌ</span></b>  One <i>who fears men,</i> or <i>is frightened at
them:</i> (K:) or one <i>who fears,</i> or <i>is frightened,
much,</i> or <i>often;</i> (O;) [and] so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَزَّاعَةٌ</span></b> . (TA.
